{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like solving nonograms, then you've come to the right place! Nonogos is a puzzle game in which you solve nonograms, of which the puzzle grids can have any dimensions. That about sums it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who have not heard of nonograms may be asking themselves, &quot;What is a nonogram?&quot; The premise is similar to sudoku in that you fill out a grid with the help of numbers, but that's also where the similarities end. Each row and column of the grid has one or more numbers attached to them. These numbers tell you how many spaces of that line in the grid should be filled, with each number representing a group. The groups should be separated by at least one empty space between them. Your objective is to fill the grid using the numbers to essentially create pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the demo version of Nonogos. It contains a selection of the puzzles that will be in the full game. The game is still in development, so please share your thoughts and feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082110?t=1759864915","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082110?t=1759864915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082110/44b1c19d84a4f2f9e025d33079df0d1280df2b95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759864915","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082110/44b1c19d84a4f2f9e025d33079df0d1280df2b95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759864915","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like solving nonograms, then you've come to the right place! Nonogos is a puzzle game in which you solve nonograms, of which the puzzle grids can have any dimensions. That about sums it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who have not heard of nonograms may be asking themselves, &quot;What is a nonogram?&quot; The premise is similar to sudoku in that you fill out a grid with the help of numbers, but that's also where the similarities end. Each row and column of the grid has one or more numbers attached to them. These numbers tell you how many spaces of that line in the grid should be filled, with each number representing a group. The groups should be separated by at least one empty space between them. Your objective is to fill the grid using the numbers to essentially create pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the demo version of Nonogos. It contains a selection of the puzzles that will be in the full game. The game is still in development, so please share your thoughts and feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Sebastian Sela"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3366200","name":"Nonogos"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082110/f74047be40aad1077e5123854e839e2c35268cd2/header.jpg?t=1759864915","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Nonogos Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sebastian Sela"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"7 Oct, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"htt